OL,3,GNEWSADeteriorating care puts home in
OL,4,Aspecial measures
OL,5,
OL,6,FA care home has been placed into
OL,7,Fspecial measures after inspectors found
OL,8,Fcare had "deteriorated" and regulations
OL,9,Frelating to care and safeguarding were
OL,10,Fbreached.
OL,12,FThe Care Quality Commission (CQC) said
OL,13,Fit had downgraded the rating of Mr C's
OL,14,Fin Torquay, Devon, from good to
OL,15,Finadequate and put it into special
OL,16,Fmeasures to "protect people" following
OL,17,Fan inspection in July.
OL,19,FRun by Woodland Healthcare Limited the
OL,20,Fcare home provides accommodation and
OL,21,Fcare for up to 40 older people,
OL,22,Fincluding people living with dementia.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
